  [38;5;246m2.[39m [ ] Assignment changed
  [38;5;246mTask assigned or reassigned. Notifies the new assignee and existing watchers.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m [ ] Due date changed
  [38;5;246mDeadline set, moved, or cleared. High signal for anyone planning around it.[39m
  [38;5;246m4.[39m [ ] Comments & @mentions
  [38;5;246mRequires designing a comments subsystem too — adds a sub-project before notifications can ship.[39m
